  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="机电系统故障诊断与维修案例教程">
      <data key="d0">机电系统故障诊断与维修案例教程</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The "机电系统故障诊断与维修案例教程" (Manual for the Diagnosis and Repair of Mechanical and Electrical System Faults and Examples) is an extensive tutorial designed to provide comprehensive guidance on diagnosing and repairing mechanical and electrical system failures. This educational resource encompasses the fault diagnosis and maintenance of electromechanical systems, focusing on various components such as motors, gears, and hydraulic systems. It includes practical examples and case studies, offering step-by-step instructions for identifying and resolving equipment failures, including crawling failures in hydraulic systems. The tutorial serves as a valuable guide for understanding system failures and their repairs, as well as providing troubleshooting and repair information for electrical and mechanical systems. The manual is a comprehensive document that covers not only the theoretical aspects of fault diagnosis but also the practical maintenance and repair of these systems, ensuring that users gain a deep understanding of both the diagnosis and repair processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38ec40877542b158053abdf9a8e353e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c4c9aed22f7c88a32676cf5c2841204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e2a9562801b3fee268d25f937ac27b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6103ba22bb6c61bce7a5a49c9d15bd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-763bd983c9440f6332b03769ffa52077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa66717db2d8392ca7818f0ab87af2b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c024958832b9f4d0025ff359e81b3839&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36dcf6c0515691cd21aa7ba7814e1b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f8d626c0daad789485fb4b40abae42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0a9d9911a119de81d8e1c006a65b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35c2bb9ed0bc329c7dffda457d26e5a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c5c0ac16b6c6ab477cbbbb517cca40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-205e5b50ed08e4587699576c3110fefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2245fdfdc1958408d69af10a1727ab5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f385a3bd2ff1fdb44455a2c9c572dce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5313a1b2bfcb93c2968ea3919437605&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1789ced49cb3ec92b79ca0b53dac8cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8795d4866f9a3fd7af5f9fcdd83b98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa1417dfc713c2443e4b8a8b1aae3148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d02a948c6d8696d3214246a1d3817b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3358a2bb2183cbab3d69427a32474e66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-892b93766f74b10ca615fc1716b97a49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad14c102c0284b39a2b6135959a961b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74053987ce51dcf868cf342a5ea8efb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60f29046f6ed7b64daf3284ca274d836&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8a217882c9a1b2088793a95ff06b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f4045e42394a6d45a6fa712b130bfe5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc8da9dbc945bf7a681df8813510d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce35f55aea19b816755795fdfbc6828b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f200e195f66d0d1262b4e03628e37e74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
