    <node id="设备故障">
      <data key="d0">设备故障</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A category of issues that arise with equipment, which may be prevented or improved to avoid recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;Equipment failure is an event that can lead to catastrophic damage to the entire system or the environment related to the equipment, resulting in significant economic losses and safety risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Equipment failure refers to the breakdown or malfunction of equipment that affects its normal operation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ad14c102c0284b39a2b6135959a961b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c4c9aed22f7c88a32676cf5c2841204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cde666ee942b8de11cef408152ad26cc</data>
