    <node id="故障">
      <data key="d0">故障</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A fault, as described across various contexts, refers to a problem or failure in the operation of mechanical, electrical, or hydraulic systems. It encompasses issues or malfunctions that can arise in different components, such as hydraulic system parts, oil atomizer systems, and systems with thermal relays or motors. Faults are indicative of potential locations and ranges where malfunctions might occur within a system. These issues can lead to the system or component not meeting its specified requirements, which often results in a failure or malfunction. Faults can be identified and addressed through maintenance and repair processes, and are critical to monitor and resolve in order to ensure the proper functioning of equipment. The text highlights that a fault can manifest as a malfunction, defect, or abnormal state in these systems, emphasizing the importance of timely detection and resolution to prevent further complications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-071028eba5f63a073b065918395fac1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12b8d796408b133d3c0527a86eb30f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc8da9dbc945bf7a681df8813510d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbf256f33d4bb639e61b480693705fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ab26354c6f007a3a303c35c4cfc45d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51df47410675f88b40ee5775ddf467a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4872ddd77cc800597c3ee787f9eb86f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07b41e601c2450e9357224ccdeaae5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da66b4ba559873998867a86514a5f09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8795d4866f9a3fd7af5f9fcdd83b98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faf021a1e9f43704271816ef558f91b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a67262b1073d1def471621ad587f09d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752703</data>
    </node>
    <node id="设备">
      <data key="d0">设备</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity in question, referred to as "设备" or "equipment," encompasses a diverse range of devices and machinery that are integral to industrial and manufacturing processes. These devices include but are not limited to wave filters, filters, inverters, and motors, which are utilized across various applications. These pieces of equipment are susceptible to failure, noise interference, and may experience issues due to gaps in their components, leading to potential corrosion. To ensure optimal operation, such equipment necessitates regular maintenance and repair, which is essential for both performance and longevity. The text primarily focuses on these equipment and machinery, emphasizing their requirement for maintenance, inspection, and the need for repair to prevent or address failures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-623a32437525b92488112ad88f55f63d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e3fd9231e91f4d605026c7e65ac9e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04cea29d26cccba82114b00118a166e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbf256f33d4bb639e61b480693705fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1789ced49cb3ec92b79ca0b53dac8cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f200e195f66d0d1262b4e03628e37e74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b63eb0311253db7aca01b3c848aeff32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7507a07ddc312326cac5e8f536d5ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75a60589f148604737e73dda0982c00b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752706</data>
    </node>
    <node id="零部件">
      <data key="d0">零部件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Parts and components are the individual elements that make up mechanical equipment, each with its specific function and characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Parts are the individual components that make up a larger mechanical assembly or equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;Parts connected to the shaft can be damaged due to the shaft heating.&lt;SEP&gt;Parts of a machine or system that can fail and lead to overall failure if not functioning correctly.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9faeed8bfe22cedda2f9a100d7b556bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ec40877542b158053abdf9a8e353e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbf256f33d4bb639e61b480693705fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e2a9562801b3fee268d25f937ac27b4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
