      <data key="d0">机电设备故障诊断与维修基础</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The basic knowledge of electromechanical equipment fault diagnosis and maintenance is a field that deals with the diagnosis and maintenance of electromechanical equipment faults.&lt;SEP&gt;The basic knowledge of fault diagnosis and maintenance for electromechanical equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;The book '机电设备故障诊断与维修基础' is a foundational text on equipment fault diagnosis and maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;This category refers to the fundamental knowledge and principles of equipment maintenance and repair, which is essential for the text's context.</data>
