      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Mechanical properties are attributes such as strength, hardness, and the bond strength of the repair layer to the part, which are important for evaluating repair quality.&lt;SEP&gt;The physical properties of a material, such as its strength and hardness.</data>
