    </node>
    <node id="锻">
      <data key="d0">锻</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">锻是指将金属加热后，在压力下使之变形，以获得所需形状和尺寸的工艺过程。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752706</data>
    </node>
    <node id="焊">
      <data key="d0">焊</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">焊是指利用高温或其他方法，使两种或多种金属连接在一起的工艺过程。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752706</data>
    </node>
    <node id="热处理">
      <data key="d0">热处理</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A process used to alter the physical and mechanical properties of a material by heating and cooling it.&lt;SEP&gt;Heat treatment is a process used to alter the physical and sometimes chemical properties of a material by heating and cooling it in a controlled manner.&lt;SEP&gt;热处理是指通过加热、保温和冷却的方式，改变金属材料的组织结构和性能的过程。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752706</data>
    </node>
    <node id="切削加工">
      <data key="d0">切削加工</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A manufacturing process used to remove material from a workpiece to create the desired shape and dimensions.&lt;SEP&gt;切削加工是指利用切削工具，从工件上切除多余材料，以获得所需形状和尺寸的加工方法。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752706</data>
    </node>
    <node id="应力集中">
      <data key="d0">应力集中</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Stress concentration refers to an area where the stress in a material is higher than the average, increasing the risk of failure.&lt;SEP&gt;应力集中是指材料在局部区域承受较大应力，可能导致材料破坏的现象。&lt;SEP&gt;应力集中是指由于几何形状的不连续或材料中的不连续导致的局部应力集中现象。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54a35b13a1fcc4fc2037db2f74a6a1e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f8d626c0daad789485fb4b40abae42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752706</data>
    </node>
    <node id="局部缺陷">
      <data key="d0">局部缺陷</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">局部缺陷是指材料上存在的尺寸、形状、表面或内部的不连续性。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752706</data>
    </node>
