      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">微观裂纹是指材料内部的微小裂纹，可能发展成为宏观裂纹。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752706</data>
    </node>
    <node id="装配质量">
      <data key="d0">装配质量</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The quality of assembly in the repair process, ensuring that components fit correctly and meet specifications.&lt;SEP&gt;装配质量是指产品在装配过程中达到的质量标准。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46885d31fae13fa1f5fc3de895a8bc31</data>
