    </node>
    <node id="工作条件">
      <data key="d0">工作条件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Optimizing working conditions, such as avoiding excessive loads, high speeds, and temperatures, can reduce wear.&lt;SEP&gt;工作条件是指机械设备实际工作时的环境条件。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512a577252da2b6701f9a8656b72a4ab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
