    <node id="计划预防维修制">
      <data key="d0">计划预防维修制</data>
      <data key="d1">economic_policy</data>
      <data key="d2">Plan preventive maintenance system is a maintenance system based on the wear规律of equipment, maintaining a predetermined maintenance cycle and following maintenance regulations to ensure the equipment is in good technical condition.&lt;SEP&gt;计划预防维修制是指在掌握机电设备磨损和损坏规律的基础上，通过定期检查、按时保养、计划维修等措施，防止和减少故障。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e246e13c7735682855bcf3af1c7da37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f82e5f14b54134cc3c1873f2a7b18506</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752708</data>
    </node>
    <node id="计划保修制">
      <data key="d0">计划保修制</data>
      <data key="d1">economic_policy</data>
      <data key="d2">Plan warranty system is a maintenance system that combines maintenance and maintenance planning, with different maintenance categories and intervals based on the characteristics and conditions of equipment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f82e5f14b54134cc3c1873f2a7b18506</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752708</data>
    </node>
    <node id="状态监测维修">
      <data key="d0">状态监测维修</data>
      <data key="d1">economic_policy</data>
      <data key="d2">Condition monitoring maintenance is a preventive maintenance method based on the actual technical condition of the equipment, using various inspections, maintenance, use, and repair information to make correct judgments about the deterioration of the equipment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f82e5f14b54134cc3c1873f2a7b18506</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752708</data>
    </node>
    <node id="可靠性维修">
      <data key="d0">可靠性维修</data>
      <data key="d1">economic_policy</data>
      <data key="d2">Reliability-centered maintenance (RCM) is a preventive maintenance method that emerged in the 1960s in the US civil aviation industry, now applied in industries with high reliability requirements such as nuclear power and military industries.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f82e5f14b54134cc3c1873f2a7b18506</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752708</data>
    </node>
    <node id="质量维修">
      <data key="d0">质量维修</data>
      <data key="d1">economic_policy</data>
      <data key="d2">Quality maintenance is a maintenance program designed to ensure that all quality characteristics of product parts are kept in optimal condition, focusing on the relationship between equipment and quality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f82e5f14b54134cc3c1873f2a7b18506</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752708</data>
    </node>
    <node id="改善维修">
      <data key="d0">改善维修</data>
      <data key="d1">economic_policy</data>
      <data key="d2">Improvement maintenance is a type of maintenance that aims to prevent the recurrence of failures by improving the technical performance of electromechanical equipment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f82e5f14b54134cc3c1873f2a7b18506</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752708</data>
    </node>
