    </node>
    <node id="机电设备">
      <data key="d0">机电设备</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Equipment and machinery are vital components of industrial operations, requiring proper maintenance and use.&lt;SEP&gt;机电设备是一类机械设备，其维修和使用需要特定的注意和技能。&lt;SEP&gt;机电设备是指应用于各种工业、商业和其他领域的设备，涉及精度、性能和效率等多个方面。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e246e13c7735682855bcf3af1c7da37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89c33b1709aba69300fa32c8a1899f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867a4342f2d363853256548ad11eb4d5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752708</data>
    </node>
    <node id="技术改进和结构改造">
      <data key="d0">技术改进和结构改造</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">技术改进和结构改造是指对机电设备进行的技术升级和结构优化，以提高其可靠性和技术水平。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e246e13c7735682855bcf3af1c7da37</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752708</data>
    </node>
    <node id="维修">
      <data key="d0">维修</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Maintenance, often referred to as repair, is a comprehensive process that encompasses identifying, correcting, and preventing faults in hydraulic systems,机电设备, and their various components. This process is essential for restoring the functionality of equipment and ensuring that systems and machines remain in good working order. It involves the repair and restoration of devices and systems to their proper working condition, which can include fixing, adjusting, or restoring them to an operational state. This maintenance process can be applied to a wide range of equipment, such as hydraulic systems, heat relays, and motors. The goal of maintenance is to prevent future issues and to extend the lifespan of the equipment by keeping it in optimal condition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c409a3cee64edbdc95bfdfc6401b9a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51df47410675f88b40ee5775ddf467a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1789ced49cb3ec92b79ca0b53dac8cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e246e13c7735682855bcf3af1c7da37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07b41e601c2450e9357224ccdeaae5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8795d4866f9a3fd7af5f9fcdd83b98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a734b5ec51b2bb03d30dfdf56a196e8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d3b4640c2971d1da053004b90733694</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="无维修设计">
      <data key="d0">无维修设计</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">无维修设计是指在新设备设计阶段就考虑维修问题，以降低维修工作量。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e246e13c7735682855bcf3af1c7da37</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
