    <node id="状态监测">
      <data key="d0">状态监测</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">State monitoring is a maintenance system based on reliability theory, condition monitoring, and fault diagnosis, determining maintenance timing and scope based on actual technical conditions of mechanical and electrical equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;State monitoring is the process of collecting data on the operating conditions of equipment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a734b5ec51b2bb03d30dfdf56a196e8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d3b4640c2971d1da053004b90733694</data>
