    </node>
    <node id="针对性维修制">
      <data key="d0">针对性维修制</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Targeted maintenance system involves implementing various repair methods based on equipment classification.&lt;SEP&gt;Targeted maintenance system is a maintenance approach based on comprehensive management principles and reliability-centered maintenance philosophy, aiming for the most economic life cycle costs and comprehensive benefits by using decision-making technology, computer technology, and condition monitoring and fault diagnosis technology.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-867a4342f2d363853256548ad11eb4d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a734b5ec51b2bb03d30dfdf56a196e8f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="点检制">
      <data key="d0">点检制</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Inspection system is a part of the targeted maintenance system, which involves regular and detailed inspections of mechanical and electrical equipment to provide information for maintenance timing and scope.&lt;SEP&gt;Point inspection system is a method of targeted maintenance for equipment classification.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-867a4342f2d363853256548ad11eb4d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a734b5ec51b2bb03d30dfdf56a196e8f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="维修工作">
      <data key="d0">维修工作</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Maintenance work involves the process of repairing and ensuring the normal operation of mechanical equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance work is a process of ensuring targeted and effective repair work.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance work refers to the activities involved in repairing machine equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of conducting maintenance tasks on equipment to ensure proper functioning.&lt;SEP&gt;The tasks performed during the maintenance of equipment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-867a4342f2d363853256548ad11eb4d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ec40877542b158053abdf9a8e353e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04cea29d26cccba82114b00118a166e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f200e195f66d0d1262b4e03628e37e74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b63eb0311253db7aca01b3c848aeff32</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
