    <node id="定期维护">
      <data key="d0">定期维护</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Regular maintenance, or first-level maintenance, is performed by operators with assistance from maintenance personnel.&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduled maintenance refers to maintenance tasks that are performed at regular intervals, such as weekly, monthly, or quarterly.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-867a4342f2d363853256548ad11eb4d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75a60589f148604737e73dda0982c00b</data>
