    <node id="设备开机前按日常检查卡规定项目检查各操作手柄、控制装置是否处于停机位置">
      <data key="d0">设备开机前按日常检查卡规定项目检查各操作手柄、控制装置是否处于停机位置</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Before starting equipment, check the operation handles and control devices according to the daily inspection card to ensure they are in the shutdown position.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="检查电线、控制柜是否破损，所处环境是否可靠，设备的接地或接零等设施是否安全">
      <data key="d0">检查电线、控制柜是否破损，所处环境是否可靠，设备的接地或接零等设施是否安全</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Inspect for wire and control cabinet damage, reliability of the environment, and safety of grounding or zeroing facilities for the equipment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="润滑和液压装置的油质、油量；按润滑图表规定加油，保持油液清洁，油路畅通，润滑良好">
      <data key="d0">润滑和液压装置的油质、油量；按润滑图表规定加油，保持油液清洁，油路畅通，润滑良好</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Checking the quality and quantity of lubricating oil and hydraulic system, and following the lubrication chart to maintain clean oil, clear oil lines, and good lubrication.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="各部件正常无误后，可先空车低速运转3～5 min">
      <data key="d0">各部件正常无误后，可先空车低速运转3～5 min</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">After confirming that all components are normal, the equipment can be operated at low speed for 3 to 5 minutes without load.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="设备运转时，严禁用手调整测量工件或进行润滑、清除杂物、擦拭设备">
      <data key="d0">设备运转时，严禁用手调整测量工件或进行润滑、清除杂物、擦拭设备</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">It is strictly prohibited to adjust, measure workpieces, or lubricate, remove debris, or wipe equipment with hands while the equipment is running.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="维护保养及清理设备、仪表时，应确认设备、仪表已处于停机状态且电源已完全关闭">
      <data key="d0">维护保养及清理设备、仪表时，应确认设备、仪表已处于停机状态且电源已完全关闭</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">When maintaining and cleaning equipment and instruments, ensure that the equipment and instruments are in the shutdown state and the power is completely off.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
    </node>
    <node id="维护设备时，要正确使用拆卸工具，严禁乱装乱拆，不得随意拆除、改变设备的安全保护装置">
      <data key="d0">维护设备时，要正确使用拆卸工具，严禁乱装乱拆，不得随意拆除、改变设备的安全保护装置</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">When maintaining equipment, use disassembly tools correctly, do not disassemble randomly, and do not arbitrarily remove or change the safety protection devices of the equipment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752711</data>
