    <node id="电源">
      <data key="d0">电源</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity referred to as "电源" is an essential component that serves as the source of electrical energy for various devices and systems. It is a system or organization responsible for providing electrical power to motors and their associated components. Issues with the power supply can lead to motor problems, as it is integral to the proper operation of motors and electromagnetic valves. In its function, the power supply ensures that devices and systems receive the necessary electrical energy to operate effectively. Essentially, the 电源 is the primary source of electrical energy for the motor, enabling it to run and function properly across different applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07931f37373e1b2ec4c7b188669c1e09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1e8bd51981f8100b6363185c3e9517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9a115a0aab11c06dbf9d37ae8dc8807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7717f9c647b8d45b1cefa44db848f23a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33e23acdd91f6c00f8ea0955e56b43ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852ace874429ae21c31ce3e548a87d0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-623a32437525b92488112ad88f55f63d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa1417dfc713c2443e4b8a8b1aae3148</data>
