      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Manufacturing involves the production process of a product, which can introduce defects that may cause failures.&lt;SEP&gt;制造是液压系统组件生产的环节，确保组件质量。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9e2c63145fc1bb1fe0be9ef3ce9a219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60f29046f6ed7b64daf3284ca274d836</data>
