      <data key="d0">磨合载荷</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Machining load is the force applied to a workpiece during the machining process, which can affect the wear of the tool and workpiece surfaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60f29046f6ed7b64daf3284ca274d836</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
