      <data key="d0">磨损现象</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Wear phenomenon refers to the transfer of material from one surface to another or simultaneous transfer of materials from both surfaces leading to wear.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
