      <data key="d0">磨料磨损失效</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Abrasive wear is a common and severe failure mode in which the material on the surface of the friction pair is worn away by abrasion particles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
