    <node id="润滑">
      <data key="d0">润滑</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Lubrication is the process of applying a lubricant to reduce friction between moving parts, improving efficiency and longevity.&lt;SEP&gt;Lubrication is the process of using an ideal fluid friction to replace dry friction, which is an effective method to reduce friction and wear.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3f4045e42394a6d45a6fa712b130bfe5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8</data>
