      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
    </node>
    <node id="表面处理">
      <data key="d0">表面处理</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Surface treatment methods such as surface heat treatment, surface chemical heat treatment, thermal spraying, welding, plating, deposition, ion implantation, rolling, and shot peening are used to improve the wear resistance of surfaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
    </node>
    <node id="结构设计">
      <data key="d0">结构设计</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Proper structural design is an effective way to reduce wear and improve wear resistance, ensuring surface film formation and recovery, even pressure distribution, friction heat dissipation, chip discharge, and prevention of external particles and dust entry.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
    </node>
    <node id="修复质量">
      <data key="d0">修复质量</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Improving the quality of mechanical processing, repair, assembly, and installation is an effective measure to prevent and reduce wear.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
    </node>
    <node id="金属腐蚀">
      <data key="d0">金属腐蚀</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Metal corrosion is a phenomenon caused by the reaction of metal with the surrounding medium, leading to damage and failure of metal parts.&lt;SEP&gt;Metal corrosion is divided into two main categories: chemical corrosion and electrochemical corrosion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f1d70a27d38bd5958000f010d50574</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
    </node>
    <node id="化学腐蚀">
      <data key="d0">化学腐蚀</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Chemical corrosion of metal is caused by a simple chemical reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical corrosion of metals is a process caused by simple chemical reactions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f1d70a27d38bd5958000f010d50574</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
    </node>
    <node id="磨损失效">
      <data key="d0">磨损失效</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Wear failure is a common failure mode in mechanical systems where material is worn away due to friction and contact.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
    </node>
    <node id="磨料">
      <data key="d0">磨料</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Abrasive particles are hard materials used to remove material from a surface, often causing wear.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed1d66300ee50fa3b2a448b0a6e37ef8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752713</data>
    </node>
