    <node id="润滑油">
      <data key="d0">润滑油</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Lubricating oil is a crucial substance designed to minimize friction and wear between moving parts in machinery and equipment. It is a liquid that serves as a protective coating for metal components, effectively reducing the risk of corrosion and extending the lifespan of these parts. This oil is utilized in the oil atomizer system to further enhance its friction-reducing capabilities. The descriptions collectively highlight that lubricating oil is a fundamental element in maintaining the efficiency and durability of mechanical systems by ensuring smooth operation of the components involved.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c2245fdfdc1958408d69af10a1727ab5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a67262b1073d1def471621ad587f09d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1e8bd51981f8100b6363185c3e9517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da71d339cddfe10d4c69101282de0424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0a9d9911a119de81d8e1c006a65b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f1d70a27d38bd5958000f010d50574&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1a16c9f096c6a79d94da29203c60f6</data>
