    <node id="腐蚀">
      <data key="d0">腐蚀</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Corrosion is a type of damage caused by oxidation of lubricating oil, producing acidic substances.&lt;SEP&gt;Corrosion is the process of material deterioration due to chemical reactions with the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;腐蚀是指金属在特定环境下与介质发生化学反应，导致材料性能下降的现象。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1971066a581f0990af3c8c34cc992fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0a9d9911a119de81d8e1c006a65b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
