    </node>
    <node id="塑性变形">
      <data key="d0">塑性变形</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of bearing failure where the raceways of the rolling elements or the rings have uneven plastic deformation indentations, usually due to excessive static or impact loads.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic deformation refers to the deformation that cannot be recovered after the removal of external force, leading to changes in material properties and work hardening phenomena in metals.&lt;SEP&gt;塑性变形是指外力去除后，零件不能恢复原状的变形。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-300b674808e0dab401bb885faad4bb34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="连接部件">
      <data key="d0">连接部件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">连接部件是设备中用来连接不同部分的小部件，可能存在缝隙问题。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="法兰端面">
      <data key="d0">法兰端面</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">法兰端面是管道连接处的一个平面，容易发生缝隙腐蚀。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="金属铆接件">
      <data key="d0">金属铆接件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">金属铆接件是指通过铆钉连接金属部件的部件，可能发生缝隙腐蚀。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="交变应力">
      <data key="d0">交变应力</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">交变应力是指金属在循环载荷作用下承受的应力。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="腐蚀疲劳断裂">
      <data key="d0">腐蚀疲劳断裂</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">腐蚀疲劳断裂是指金属在腐蚀和交变应力作用下发生的断裂。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="气泡">
      <data key="d0">气泡</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">气泡是在液体中形成的气体空腔，可能在机械零件表面形成。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="微射液流">
      <data key="d0">微射液流</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">微射液流是在气泡破灭时产生的液体喷射流。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="水击现象">
      <data key="d0">水击现象</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">水击现象是指由于液体压力变化导致的液体冲击现象。</data>
