      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="乳化油">
      <data key="d0">乳化油</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">乳化油是一种用于减少气泡爆破冲击力的添加剂。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="轴类零件">
      <data key="d0">轴类零件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Axial components are parts that can exhibit bending after some time, showing the phenomenon of elastic aftereffect.&lt;SEP&gt;Axial components that are part of the shaft assembly in machinery, often requiring specific removal procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;轴类零件是机械中用于传递旋转运动的零件，可能发生弹性或塑性变形。&lt;SEP&gt;轴类零件是机械设备中的关键零件，包括转轴、心轴和传动轴。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-89c33b1709aba69300fa32c8a1899f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="校直">
      <data key="d0">校直</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">校直是指通过外力使零件恢复到正确形状的过程。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="回火">
      <data key="d0">回火</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A heat treatment process that is used to reduce the hardness and internal stresses of a material that has been quenched.&lt;SEP&gt;Tempering is a heat treatment process that follows quenching to reduce internal stresses and to soften the metal.&lt;SEP&gt;Tempering is a heat treatment process that is used to reduce internal stresses in materials and to improve their toughness and machinability.&lt;SEP&gt;回火是指将金属材料加热到一定温度后冷却的处理方法，以消除应力。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-882922efd912fc44b6859f8eed2fb13e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="机械零件">
      <data key="d0">机械零件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Mechanical components are parts that are assembled together to form a machine or mechanism, and they can undergo various types of deformation and failure modes.&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanical parts that may require repair or maintenance due to wear or damage.&lt;SEP&gt;机械零件是组成机械设备的基本单元，可能因腐蚀或应力发生变形。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="尺寸">
      <data key="d0">尺寸</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">尺寸是指零件的几何大小，磨损可能影响尺寸。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="形状">
      <data key="d0">形状</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">形状是指零件的外部轮廓，磨损可能改变形状。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="配合性质">
      <data key="d0">配合性质</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">配合性质是指零件之间的相对位置和运动关系，磨损可能影响配合。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b9aa1cf69ef2f507f89adeb826f8b153</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="弹性后效">
      <data key="d0">弹性后效</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Elastic aftereffect is the bending that occurs in axial components after a period of time.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="长时间回火">
      <data key="d0">长时间回火</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Long-term tempering is a method used to eliminate the elastic aftereffect by completely removing stress in a short period of time.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="加工硬化现象">
      <data key="d0">加工硬化现象</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Work hardening is a phenomenon caused by plastic deformation that makes the metal more difficult to work with.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="原子活动能力">
      <data key="d0">原子活动能力</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Atomic activity ability refers to the increased mobility of atoms during plastic deformation, which can lead to a decrease in the corrosion resistance of metals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="体积变形">
      <data key="d0">体积变形</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Volume deformation occurs in metal parts during heating and cooling due to changes in the microstructure, causing the parts to expand or contract.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="翘曲变形">
      <data key="d0">翘曲变形</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Warping deformation refers to the bending or twisting deformation of a part, which can occur due to different types of deformation (bending, torsion, tension, etc.) and deformation in different directions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8aca48788ebf46b14f234652a9c385da</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
