    <node id="残余压应力">
      <data key="d0">残余压应力</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A stress that remains in a material after the external forces are removed, which can be created by various processing methods like carburizing, nitriding, shot peening, and surface rolling.&lt;SEP&gt;残余压应力是指材料在加工或处理过程中产生的压缩应力。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f3eefb802b6226705cf5fc0c85fd4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54a35b13a1fcc4fc2037db2f74a6a1e6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="塑性变形、热胀冷缩及金相组织转变">
      <data key="d0">塑性变形、热胀冷缩及金相组织转变</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">塑性变形、热胀冷缩及金相组织转变是指材料在加工或处理过程中发生的物理和化学变化。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54a35b13a1fcc4fc2037db2f74a6a1e6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="渗碳">
      <data key="d0">渗碳</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A heat treating process that introduces carbon into the surface of a metal by diffusion, creating residual compressive stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;Carburizing is a heat treatment process that diffuses carbon into the surface of a steel to increase its hardness.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f3eefb802b6226705cf5fc0c85fd4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-882922efd912fc44b6859f8eed2fb13e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="渗氮">
      <data key="d0">渗氮</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A heat treating process that introduces nitrogen into the surface of a metal, also creating residual compressive stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitriding is a heat treatment process that diffuses nitrogen into the surface of a metal to improve its surface hardness and wear resistance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f3eefb802b6226705cf5fc0c85fd4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-882922efd912fc44b6859f8eed2fb13e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="表面滚压加工">
      <data key="d0">表面滚压加工</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A metal forming process that uses a roller to compress the surface of a metal to create compressive residual stresses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f3eefb802b6226705cf5fc0c85fd4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="外载荷">
      <data key="d0">外载荷</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">External loads that act on a mechanical component, which can create tensile stresses that are counteracted by residual compressive stresses introduced by the mentioned processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f3eefb802b6226705cf5fc0c85fd4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
    <node id="断裂源">
      <data key="d0">断裂源</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A location in a material where a crack can initiate and propagate, particularly in components with surface stresses introduced by processing methods like渗碳, 渗氮, 喷丸, 表面滚压加工.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f3eefb802b6226705cf5fc0c85fd4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752715</data>
    </node>
