    <node id="电镀">
      <data key="d0">电镀</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A process that involves the deposition of a thin layer of metal onto a surface by electrolysis, improving wear resistance of the part.&lt;SEP&gt;Electroplating is a process of depositing a layer of metal onto a surface by using an electric current.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f3eefb802b6226705cf5fc0c85fd4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-882922efd912fc44b6859f8eed2fb13e</data>
