      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A process of welding a layer of metal onto the surface of another metal to improve its wear resistance and other properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Stack welding is a welding process used to deposit layers of metal on a workpiece to improve its performance or restore dimensions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6f3eefb802b6226705cf5fc0c85fd4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
