    <node id="机床">
      <data key="d0">机床</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The机床, a category of machine tools, is a specialized type of machinery designed for the precision shaping and cutting of metal and other materials. It is a key component in the manufacturing process, serving as a device used to machine metal or other materials into desired shapes. These machine tools are integral for metal cutting and shaping operations, and they are employed in the production of various mechanical parts. The机床 is characterized by its ability to not only fabricate components but also conduct precision inspections on them. Specific design and performance criteria are mentioned, particularly noting that when the quality of the机床 exceeds 10 tons, the precision tolerance should be less than 25mm. This emphasizes the high standards and stringent requirements associated with the design and operation of these machine tools.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-46885d31fae13fa1f5fc3de895a8bc31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ded8b04c66f89e14f00b1825589411c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04cea29d26cccba82114b00118a166e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da71d339cddfe10d4c69101282de0424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-851085d549e025dde671ad0bf0a6245d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1a16c9f096c6a79d94da29203c60f6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752718</data>
    </node>
    <node id="维修工">
      <data key="d0">维修工</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Maintenance workers are professionals responsible for repairing mechanical equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of repairing machinery and equipment, including the steps and requirements for successful maintenance.</data>
