      <data key="d0">心轴锥体</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">心轴锥体是机床心轴上的锥形部分，用于与主轴锥孔或尾座锥孔配合。文中提到心轴锥体的接触面积应满足一定要求。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ded8b04c66f89e14f00b1825589411c3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752718</data>
    </node>
    <node id="液压系统">
      <data key="d0">液压系统</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The hydraulic system is a sophisticated power transmission system that utilizes fluid power to transmit and manage energy across various applications. It encompasses a multitude of components designed to facilitate motion and control. These components work in concert to convert hydraulic fluid power into mechanical work, thereby driving the movement of mechanical devices. The system is characterized by its complexity, with potential for failures due to improper use and maintenance, which can lead to increased equipment failure rates and reduced lifespan.

The hydraulic system is integral to mechanical and electrical systems, and it may be prone to overheating due to a variety of factors. It is a critical part of industrial automation, automotive, and aviation applications, and it is designed to handle the flow of hydraulic fluid efficiently. This system is subject to regular maintenance and repair processes to ensure optimal performance.

Comprising elements such as pipes, valves, and reservoirs, the hydraulic system is a multifaceted mechanism that involves the coordination of numerous hydraulic components. It is a common subject of analysis and diagnosis, focusing on its components and the principles that govern its operation. The system may experience various faults, including seal failure, leakage, and issues related to component quality.

In its role within mechanical systems, such as in machine tools, the hydraulic system is responsible for the transmission of power and the realization of diverse actions. The text emphasizes that the assembly quality of the hydraulic system should meet certain standards to ensure its proper functioning. Furthermore, the system employs a variety of pumps, including the widely used vane pumps, to transmit energy and control through the application of fluid pressure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ded8b04c66f89e14f00b1825589411c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9784ee50339b8dae5e16fe13763d736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcbbc0ef278995bc572c753ceef85338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53ef862a9e23d86099ddd8d1672a7b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35c2bb9ed0bc329c7dffda457d26e5a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db0d804303b37c024cff2c6691c1842&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e3fd9231e91f4d605026c7e65ac9e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dba5683e0ed1465472acb33aeab7170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5313a1b2bfcb93c2968ea3919437605&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da71d339cddfe10d4c69101282de0424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f2347b9a7d0af4e8a8b655b61c5d5d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d02a948c6d8696d3214246a1d3817b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af5a36d856b334200291be646fe56c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8a217882c9a1b2088793a95ff06b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e927ef66eacdc3741d7a8dbda2d77531&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc8da9dbc945bf7a681df8813510d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce35f55aea19b816755795fdfbc6828b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4872ddd77cc800597c3ee787f9eb86f1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752723</data>
    </node>
    <node id="润滑系统">
      <data key="d0">润滑系统</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Lubrication system is responsible for providing lubrication to moving parts to reduce friction and wear.&lt;SEP&gt;The lubrication system can have issues with excessive oil supply and high pressure, leading to oil leakage from the bearing cover.&lt;SEP&gt;The lubrication system is a system that provides lubrication to the moving parts of the machinery to reduce wear, as described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;润滑系统是机床中用于润滑各运动部件的系统。文中提到润滑系统的质量应满足一定要求。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ded8b04c66f89e14f00b1825589411c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da71d339cddfe10d4c69101282de0424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75a60589f148604737e73dda0982c00b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e2a9562801b3fee268d25f937ac27b4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752723</data>
    </node>
