    <node id="压力表">
      <data key="d0">压力表</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A pressure gauge is a device used to measure the pressure of a fluid in a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Pressure gauge is used to measure the pressure in the hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;The pressure gauge is a device used to measure the pressure of the compressed air in the system.&lt;SEP&gt;The pressure gauge, which should be sensitive and reliable with clear readings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ded8b04c66f89e14f00b1825589411c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdcf0dd4905e0f769167e1362f8c973b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc8da9dbc945bf7a681df8813510d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce35f55aea19b816755795fdfbc6828b</data>
