      <data key="d5">1748752723</data>
    </node>
    <node id="油箱">
      <data key="d0">油箱</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The oil tank is a crucial component within the hydraulic system, serving as a container specifically designed for storing hydraulic oil. This reservoir not only holds the hydraulic fluid but also plays a pivotal role in the system's overall functionality. The oil tank is connected to the hydraulic cylinder and is integral in the circulation and cooling of the hydraulic oil. It is designed to prevent contamination, which can lead to system failure, and is constructed to minimize foam production and maintain an oil temperature that does not exceed 60℃. In addition to storing oil, the oil tank is also responsible for dissipating heat and facilitating the continuous flow of hydraulic oil within the system. It acts as an auxiliary device in the hydraulic system, contributing to the system's performance by ensuring the smooth operation and circulation of hydraulic fluid. The oil tank may experience vibrations due to its interaction with the hydraulic pump and motor, and it is a component that is integral to the storage and recirculation of oil in the hydraulic system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-25d02a948c6d8696d3214246a1d3817b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-071028eba5f63a073b065918395fac1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8a217882c9a1b2088793a95ff06b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ded8b04c66f89e14f00b1825589411c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc8da9dbc945bf7a681df8813510d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce35f55aea19b816755795fdfbc6828b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07b41e601c2450e9357224ccdeaae5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f2347b9a7d0af4e8a8b655b61c5d5d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcbbc0ef278995bc572c753ceef85338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53ef862a9e23d86099ddd8d1672a7b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-906931c649f16a44721b0eebb71f69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e2c63145fc1bb1fe0be9ef3ce9a219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e9e21580951e8a602128573cf01cefc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752727</data>
    </node>
