    </node>
    <node id="回油管">
      <data key="d0">回油管</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The return oil pipes of the hydraulic system, which should extend below the oil level to prevent foam and air intake.&lt;SEP&gt;The return pipe is a component in a hydraulic system that returns hydraulic fluid from the system back to the reservoir.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ded8b04c66f89e14f00b1825589411c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cdee98ef526ceb57736fda4635f6616</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752727</data>
    </node>
