    <node id="金属切削机床">
      <data key="d0">金属切削机床</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of machine tool used for metal cutting processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Machine tools used to cut metal into desired shapes and sizes.&lt;SEP&gt;Metal cutting machine tools are a type of machinery used for cutting metal materials, as described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Metal cutting machine tools are used for various machining operations, often requiring electrical systems for control and operation.&lt;SEP&gt;金属切削机床是一种用于金属切削加工的机床，其液压系统功率不大，工作压力中等。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da71d339cddfe10d4c69101282de0424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1971066a581f0990af3c8c34cc992fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35c2bb9ed0bc329c7dffda457d26e5a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-892b93766f74b10ca615fc1716b97a49</data>
