      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Different disassembly methods are used depending on the part fit, such as impact removal, pressing and pulling off, and heating disassembly.&lt;SEP&gt;Different techniques or methods used to remove or disassemble parts, such as bearings.&lt;SEP&gt;Disassembly methods are specific techniques used to remove parts from mechanical equipment without causing damage.&lt;SEP&gt;Methods used to remove tightly fitted components in machinery, such as using pullers or presses.&lt;SEP&gt;拆卸方法是指用于拆卸机械设备的各种方法。</data>
