    <node id="记号">
      <data key="d0">记号</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Markings are symbols or labels used to identify and differentiate parts during disassembly and reassembly processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Markings are used to identify the original positions of parts during disassembly for proper reassembly.&lt;SEP&gt;Marks made during the assembly process to indicate the original positions of gears for precise reassembly.&lt;SEP&gt;记号是在机械设备维修过程中用于标识部件和位置的标记。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-89c33b1709aba69300fa32c8a1899f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9faeed8bfe22cedda2f9a100d7b556bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ec40877542b158053abdf9a8e353e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
