    </node>
    <node id="啮合">
      <data key="d0">啮合</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The act of gears engaging with each other in a gear train to transmit motion and power.&lt;SEP&gt;The term 'meshing' refers to the engagement of two gears in a mechanical system, and is a concept related to gear assembly and precision.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752730</data>
    </node>
    <node id="齿轮">
      <data key="d0">齿轮</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The gear is a fundamental mechanical component utilized for transmitting power and motion between rotating shafts. It functions as a toothed wheel, typically part of a pair of gears that mesh to ensure efficient power transmission. Gears are integral to a wide range of machinery and systems, where they are essential for changing the speed of rotation and transferring torque. In hydraulic systems, gears act as critical传动部件, facilitating the transmission of power and enabling the generation of pressure to pump hydraulic oil. These components often necessitate precise assembly and alignment to ensure optimal performance. The text also discusses various failure forms and repair methods associated with gears, emphasizing their importance in maintaining the integrity and functionality of mechanical systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74053987ce51dcf868cf342a5ea8efb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45ba06ce22ee19f5d752b6523954299d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d3891e1b2ef18668ef809ea3822176d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0afc77668cb79a17228f50d78996acd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f8d626c0daad789485fb4b40abae42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-906931c649f16a44721b0eebb71f69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="装配误差">
      <data key="d0">装配误差</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Assembly errors are inaccuracies that can occur during the assembly of mechanical components, such as gears, which can affect their precision.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="螺纹连接">
      <data key="d0">螺纹连接</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Threaded connection, a type of mechanical fastener used to join two or more parts.&lt;SEP&gt;Threaded connections are a common method of joining parts in machinery, characterized by simplicity and ease of adjustment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-851085d549e025dde671ad0bf0a6245d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="过盈配合件">
      <data key="d0">过盈配合件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Overrunning fit components require special methods for removal due to the tight fit between parts, often using specialized tools like pullers or presses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="滚动轴承">
      <data key="d0">滚动轴承</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of bearing that uses rolling elements to maintain the separation between moving parts.&lt;SEP&gt;Rolling bearings are a type of mechanical component used to reduce friction between moving parts, and their removal requires careful handling to avoid damage.&lt;SEP&gt;Rolling bearings are components used in machinery for reducing friction and supporting loads.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-45ba06ce22ee19f5d752b6523954299d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e2a9562801b3fee268d25f937ac27b4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="不可拆连接件">
      <data key="d0">不可拆连接件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Irreparable connections, such as welded or riveted joints, are permanent and not typically dismantled during maintenance or repair.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="修复机械零件故障">
