      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Disassembly is the process of taking apart an assembly or equipment to access or remove parts for maintenance or repair.&lt;SEP&gt;The act of removing or disassembling parts, such as bearings, for repair or replacement.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of removing a bearing from a shaft or from a housing.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of removing parts from machinery for maintenance or repair, requiring careful handling to avoid damage.&lt;SEP&gt;拆卸是指将设备或部件拆开的过程。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-45ba06ce22ee19f5d752b6523954299d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-300b674808e0dab401bb885faad4bb34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5313a1b2bfcb93c2968ea3919437605&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9faeed8bfe22cedda2f9a100d7b556bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
