      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A tool with a heavy metal head used for applying force to drive or move objects, such as when removing a bearing.&lt;SEP&gt;Tool used for applying force to drive nails or to strike objects, which can be damaging if used improperly during disassembly.</data>
