    <node id="过盈量">
      <data key="d0">过盈量</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Overrun refers to the amount by which the inner diameter of the shaft sleeve exceeds the outer diameter of the shaft, affecting fit and assembly.&lt;SEP&gt;The amount by which a component is oversized when fitted into a housing, requiring effort to remove.&lt;SEP&gt;The amount by which a part is oversized to ensure a proper fit and seal in a housing or assembly.&lt;SEP&gt;The interference fit is the difference in size between the part being inserted and the hole it fits into, affecting the assembly process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3f4045e42394a6d45a6fa712b130bfe5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0a9d9911a119de81d8e1c006a65b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45ba06ce22ee19f5d752b6523954299d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752732</data>
    </node>
    <node id="修补层">
