      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A welding method that uses a flame produced by the combustion of a mixture of fuel gas and oxidizing gas to melt and join metals.&lt;SEP&gt;A welding process that uses a gas flame to melt the base metal and an filler material to form a weld.</data>
