      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A heat treatment process that hardens the surface of a material by quenching it in a liquid or air.&lt;SEP&gt;Quenching is a heat treatment process that rapidly cools a metal to increase its hardness and strength.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-882922efd912fc44b6859f8eed2fb13e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
