    <node id="钎焊">
      <data key="d0">钎焊</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A welding process that joins two pieces of metal by melting a filler material between them.&lt;SEP&gt;Soldering is a welding process that uses a lower melting point metal to join two pieces of metal by melting the solder and allowing it to wet the surfaces of the metals.&lt;SEP&gt;钎焊是一种修复技术，最适用于低速运动部件的研伤、划伤等局部缺陷的补修。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5cec839b9f36b19446104b0ebb382214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
