      <data key="d0">维修费用定额</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The maintenance cost standard is the fee standard for completing machine equipment repairs, used as a cost indicator for repair work.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-04cea29d26cccba82114b00118a166e9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
