    <node id="设备的技术状态">
      <data key="d0">设备的技术状态</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The technical condition of equipment refers to the actual situation of equipment's technical performance, load capacity, transmission mechanism, and operational safety, and is a major indicator of the quality of the equipment's technical condition.</data>
