      <data key="d0">分部维修法</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A maintenance method where individual parts of a machine are repaired in stages, maximizing production time and equipment utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;A method of maintenance that allows for the repair of equipment during holidays or non-production time to increase machine production time and equipment utilization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f200e195f66d0d1262b4e03628e37e74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1789ced49cb3ec92b79ca0b53dac8cb5</data>
