    <node id="故障诊断">
      <data key="d0">故障诊断</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Fault diagnosis is a critical process that involves the identification and analysis of issues within hydraulic systems and other systems or devices. It encompasses the thorough examination and assessment of malfunctions to pinpoint their root causes. This diagnostic procedure is essential for determining the most appropriate repair measures. Specifically, fault diagnosis is applied to systems such as piece pressing systems, where it serves to identify and resolve any issues that may arise. The process is integral to maintaining the optimal performance and reliability of the systems and devices it is applied to, as it allows for the precise identification and understanding of the causes behind malfunctions, ensuring effective resolution.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-89c33b1709aba69300fa32c8a1899f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e927ef66eacdc3741d7a8dbda2d77531&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc8da9dbc945bf7a681df8813510d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa66717db2d8392ca7818f0ab87af2b4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752734</data>
    </node>
