    <node id="油路">
      <data key="d0">油路</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Oil route refers to the passage through which oil flows in a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;The oil path is the channel through which oil flows within the oil atomizer system.&lt;SEP&gt;油路是机械设备中用于润滑油流动的路径。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-89c33b1709aba69300fa32c8a1899f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4872ddd77cc800597c3ee787f9eb86f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a67262b1073d1def471621ad587f09d</data>
