      <data key="d2">Foreign objects that can obstruct the function of mechanical components like contact points.&lt;SEP&gt;杂物是指机械设备中可能存在的各种垃圾和碎片。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-89c33b1709aba69300fa32c8a1899f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ba00d066e16d8a729e4d1d6be852341</data>
