    <node id="故障诊断与维修">
      <data key="d0">故障诊断与维修</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Fault diagnosis and maintenance refer to the process of identifying and correcting issues in mechanical components.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of diagnosing and repairing crawling failures in hydraulic systems involves identifying the cause and applying appropriate solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of diagnosing and repairing equipment malfunctions.&lt;SEP&gt;故障诊断与维修是液压系统维护的关键环节，旨在确定和修复系统故障。</data>
