      <data key="d2">Rolling elements are mounted between the inner and outer races of a rolling bearing.&lt;SEP&gt;The rolling elements in a rolling bearing that reduce friction and allow for smooth rotation.&lt;SEP&gt;The rolling elements used in a rolling bearing to reduce friction and support load.</data>
