    <node id="间隙">
      <data key="d0">间隙</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An间隙is the space between two objects or parts that need to be aligned or fit together.&lt;SEP&gt;The gap between components such as the cylinder head and the buffer piston is a critical factor that may need to be adjusted.&lt;SEP&gt;The space between the rolling elements and the raceways in a rolling bearing that allows for expansion and contraction.&lt;SEP&gt;间隙是电动机内部两个部件之间的空间距离，文中提到需要调整以防止磨损。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eba2a79b73acbc82d64797a0c6abe70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c0759493d2164571db1415c10cc5964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d81d1586fab16b83b27100e99262851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51df47410675f88b40ee5775ddf467a2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
