      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A method of power transmission that uses the meshing of gears to transfer motion and power.&lt;SEP&gt;Gear transmission is the method of power transmission between two rotating shafts using gears.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6eba2a79b73acbc82d64797a0c6abe70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d3891e1b2ef18668ef809ea3822176d</data>
