    <node id="液压传动系统">
      <data key="d0">液压传动系统</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Hydraulic transmission system is a system that uses fluid power to transmit power and motion between components.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydraulic transmission system is referred to in the context of assembly and maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;液压传动系统是一种利用液压油作为工作介质的传动系统，压力失控是常见的故障。&lt;SEP&gt;液压传动系统是一种液压技术，包括多个组件，用于传递运动和动力。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9e2c63145fc1bb1fe0be9ef3ce9a219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ba5e16308525584985e229da38004bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f876de83ca897e43ae18d8804ec7fc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74053987ce51dcf868cf342a5ea8efb7</data>
