    </node>
    <node id="液压缸">
      <data key="d0">液压缸</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The hydraulic cylinder is a mechanical actuator integral to hydraulic systems, designed to convert hydraulic energy into linear or rotary mechanical motion. Primarily used for force generation by applying pressure to a fluid, typically oil, the cylinder transforms the fluid's potential energy into linear motion, which is central to the operation of machinery and vehicles. As a component of the hydraulic system, the hydraulic cylinder is essential for a variety of applications, including pre-compression and final compression of parts. However, it is susceptible to issues such as crawling failure during low-speed operation, seal failure, leakage, system overheating, and potential problems like low speed or stopping during operation. Regular maintenance is necessary to address these issues, as well as to prevent system pressure drops due to wear and tear or damage. The hydraulic cylinder is a versatile mechanical device that plays a crucial role in the execution of various mechanical actions and the transmission of power within hydraulic systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9784ee50339b8dae5e16fe13763d736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa66717db2d8392ca7818f0ab87af2b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ba5e16308525584985e229da38004bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d81d1586fab16b83b27100e99262851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36dcf6c0515691cd21aa7ba7814e1b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07b41e601c2450e9357224ccdeaae5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a4a03155fa2a96e34f47616ffe0cae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-205e5b50ed08e4587699576c3110fefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-071028eba5f63a073b065918395fac1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db0d804303b37c024cff2c6691c1842&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e3fd9231e91f4d605026c7e65ac9e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e2c63145fc1bb1fe0be9ef3ce9a219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d02a948c6d8696d3214246a1d3817b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af5a36d856b334200291be646fe56c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74053987ce51dcf868cf342a5ea8efb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc8da9dbc945bf7a681df8813510d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce35f55aea19b816755795fdfbc6828b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67175ab18c23c1816a4f561e5a5d372b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cdee98ef526ceb57736fda4635f6616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e9e21580951e8a602128573cf01cefc</data>
