      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The hydraulic system is a component of a larger machinery or device that uses fluid power to perform work.&lt;SEP&gt;The hydraulic system is a system that can cause component wear, leakage, performance issues, and system failure due to design, manufacturing, misuse, and hydraulic oil contamination.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-18214939792a5d3dcd493f164ba9b500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7020a9dc7fa252e8a0f9eab88fecb32</data>
