      <data key="d2">The hydraulic check valve is a type of directional valve that allows fluid flow in one direction while preventing reverse flow.&lt;SEP&gt;液控单向阀是一种特殊的单向阀，通过液体压力控制阀芯的开启与关闭，用于液压系统中。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-18214939792a5d3dcd493f164ba9b500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c409a3cee64edbdc95bfdfc6401b9a15</data>
