    <node id="单向节流阀">
      <data key="d0">单向节流阀</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A one-way throttle valve used to control the exhaust speed of the hydraulic cylinder.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of flow control valve used in hydraulic systems to control the flow rate of fluid in one direction.&lt;SEP&gt;The one-way throttle valve is a device used to control fluid flow in one direction.&lt;SEP&gt;The one-way throttle valve is a hydraulic component that regulates fluid flow by controlling the flow area through a throttle orifice.&lt;SEP&gt;Unidirectional throttle valve is a type of hydraulic valve that controls fluid flow in one direction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2af5a36d856b334200291be646fe56c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dba5683e0ed1465472acb33aeab7170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18214939792a5d3dcd493f164ba9b500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b90a52c6f070fb2b7a91103d66a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c024958832b9f4d0025ff359e81b3839</data>
