    <node id="感官诊断法">
      <data key="d0">感官诊断法</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Sensory diagnosis method is a simple and convenient method for diagnosing hydraulic system faults using the principles of 'see, listen, touch, smell, read, and ask'.</data>
