    </node>
    <node id="吸油管">
      <data key="d0">吸油管</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The suction pipe, a critical component of the hydraulic system, serves as the conduit through which hydraulic fluid is drawn from the reservoir or oil tank and transported to the pump. It is integral to the oil atomizer system, where it is responsible for extracting润滑油 (lubricating oil) from the oil cup. This component is essential for maintaining the pressure within the system, as any leakage in the suction pipe can lead to a lack of pressure. The suction pipe ensures the smooth operation of the hydraulic pump by effectively moving hydraulic oil through the system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ba5e16308525584985e229da38004bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2245fdfdc1958408d69af10a1727ab5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc8da9dbc945bf7a681df8813510d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-906931c649f16a44721b0eebb71f69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cdee98ef526ceb57736fda4635f6616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a67262b1073d1def471621ad587f09d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752770</data>
    </node>
