      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Hydraulic pump or cylinder overload refers to the components being subjected to excessive force or pressure, leading to malfunctions.&lt;SEP&gt;液压泵或液压缸过载是指泵或缸承受了超出其设计承受能力的负载。</data>
