    <node id="电磁铁">
      <data key="d0">电磁铁</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An electromagnet is a type of magnetic device that produces a magnetic field when an electric current is applied.&lt;SEP&gt;Electromagnet is a device used to generate magnetic fields in hydraulic systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The electromagnet used to control the operation of an electromagnetic valve by generating a magnetic field.&lt;SEP&gt;电磁铁是一种能够产生磁场的装置，用于电磁阀中控制流体介质的流动。&lt;SEP&gt;电磁铁是电磁控制的换向阀的重要部件。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dba5683e0ed1465472acb33aeab7170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce35f55aea19b816755795fdfbc6828b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33e23acdd91f6c00f8ea0955e56b43ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9784ee50339b8dae5e16fe13763d736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19398f2e97c0d818beb2f7da07fc12c</data>
