      <data key="d2">Pump shaft is the rotating shaft that drives the pump in a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;泵轴是指液压泵的旋转轴。&lt;SEP&gt;泵轴是液压泵的核心部件，负责传递动力。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-906931c649f16a44721b0eebb71f69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9784ee50339b8dae5e16fe13763d736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5313a1b2bfcb93c2968ea3919437605</data>
