    <node id="螺钉">
      <data key="d0">螺钉</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity "螺钉" refers to a type of fastener that serves the purpose of holding objects together using a threaded rod. This mechanical element is specifically used in hydraulic systems to secure components and maintain connections, as well as in pumps to fix parts in place. In the context of a fuse, the螺钉 plays a crucial role in fastening components together, and any issues with these screws can lead to electrical faults. Essentially, the螺钉 is a fundamental mechanical component employed for connecting and fixing parts across various applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0f966e87923041bdf721a6c9dd71a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb58ef07953cfa7d2761587f8cf0115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67175ab18c23c1816a4f561e5a5d372b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4872ddd77cc800597c3ee787f9eb86f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da66b4ba559873998867a86514a5f09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9784ee50339b8dae5e16fe13763d736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52c6e3b4bdca7949382cf08a9307b76</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752773</data>
    </node>
    <node id="油液">
      <data key="d0">油液</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The hydraulic oil, also known as oil fluid, serves as a crucial working medium in hydraulic systems. It is primarily utilized for the transfer of energy from the pump to the actuators, as well as for power transmission and lubrication. Over time, this hydraulic oil can degrade, often due to contamination and oxidation, which may lead to crawling failure. To maintain optimal system performance, the oil fluid may become too contaminated, necessitating either filtration or replacement. Additionally, the oil fluid in hydraulic systems also plays a role in cooling and acts as a medium for transmitting signals within the system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-205e5b50ed08e4587699576c3110fefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-763bd983c9440f6332b03769ffa52077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9784ee50339b8dae5e16fe13763d736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53ef862a9e23d86099ddd8d1672a7b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-906931c649f16a44721b0eebb71f69b5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752775</data>
    </node>
