      <data key="d2">Electrical components are parts of the circuit that are observed for correct operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Electrical components that require high resistance measurements are being discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;The components that make up electrical equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;电气元件是液压系统中用于传输和转换电能的部件。</data>
