    <node id="安全阀">
      <data key="d0">安全阀</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The safety valve is a critical device in various systems, including hydraulic and pneumatic systems, designed to prevent overpressure by automatically releasing excess pressure when it reaches a predetermined level. It serves as a crucial component for maintaining pressure control within the system. This valve operates by opening when the pressure within the system surpasses a certain threshold, thereby relieving pressure and preventing potential damage. The safety valve is instrumental in ensuring that the system pressure does not exceed a safe level, thus safeguarding both the system and any associated equipment from harm.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91db0f3b864a7198d442ec1ab788a5bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-537459fb97a3814b19b19a55238e2279&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45c7f498930072d1430aac19bea884b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdcf0dd4905e0f769167e1362f8c973b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75a60589f148604737e73dda0982c00b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d02a948c6d8696d3214246a1d3817b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
