    <node id="振动">
      <data key="d0">振动</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Vibration is a phenomenon that may occur in hydraulic systems due to various factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Vibration is the rapid back-and-forth motion of an object around a central position.&lt;SEP&gt;Vibration refers to the oscillation or shaking of an object, which can be a result of various factors in the hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;振动是指液压系统运行时产生的机械运动，可能影响系统性能。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dba5683e0ed1465472acb33aeab7170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcbbc0ef278995bc572c753ceef85338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07931f37373e1b2ec4c7b188669c1e09</data>
