    <node id="噪声">
      <data key="d0">噪声</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Noise and resonance are mentioned as issues that may arise, suggesting the need for valve spring replacement to eliminate resonance.&lt;SEP&gt;Noise is a category of disturbance that can affect equipment performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Noise is the unwanted sound that can be produced by the hydraulic system due to various factors such as vibration and fluid flow.&lt;SEP&gt;噪声是指不希望的声音，液压泵加罩可以有效降低噪声。&lt;SEP&gt;噪声是指液压系统运行时产生的声音，可能影响周围环境和设备性能。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ba5e16308525584985e229da38004bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e3fd9231e91f4d605026c7e65ac9e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-763bd983c9440f6332b03769ffa52077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcbbc0ef278995bc572c753ceef85338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c</data>
