      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Hydraulic motor is a component that can also experience crawling failure during low-speed operation and requires maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydraulic motors are devices that convert hydraulic energy into mechanical energy.&lt;SEP&gt;液压电动机是一种利用液压油产生扭矩的装置，磨损或密封损坏可能导致系统压力下降。&lt;SEP&gt;液压电动机是液压系统中的动力源，将液压能转换为机械能。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-205e5b50ed08e4587699576c3110fefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ba5e16308525584985e229da38004bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b267dc4b30d97dadf5f4201bc2406a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6</data>
