    <node id="联轴器">
      <data key="d0">联轴器</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A device that connects two shafts and transmits power from one to the other.&lt;SEP&gt;Coupling is a device that connects two shafts and transmits power from one to the other.&lt;SEP&gt;Coupling, a component connecting the motor shaft to the pump shaft.&lt;SEP&gt;联轴器是液压系统中的连接部件，用于连接不同的机械部分。&lt;SEP&gt;联轴器用于连接电动机和液压泵，确保同心度，减少振动。</data>
