      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A device used to control the flow of fluids, in this context, an electromagnetic directional valve.&lt;SEP&gt;The valve is a general term for a device that controls the flow of fluids, mentioned in the context of various issues and maintenance procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;阀是液压系统中的控制元件，用于调节流体流动，方向阀的换向可能引起振动与噪声。&lt;SEP&gt;阀是液压系统中的控制部件，用于调节油液的流动。</data>
