    <node id="电液换向阀">
      <data key="d0">电液换向阀</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Electro-hydraulic directional valve is a hydraulic valve that uses electrical signals to control fluid flow direction.&lt;SEP&gt;The electro-hydraulic directional valve is another type of hydraulic valve mentioned, combining electromagnetic and hydraulic control.&lt;SEP&gt;电液换向阀是一种利用电信号控制流体方向的液压阀。&lt;SEP&gt;电液换向阀是一种用于控制液压系统方向的阀门，选用带阻尼的电液换向阀并调节换向速度。&lt;SEP&gt;电液换向阀是由电磁换向阀和液动换向阀组合而成的，用于改变油路流向以控制阀芯工作位置的设备。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ba5e16308525584985e229da38004bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8a217882c9a1b2088793a95ff06b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dba5683e0ed1465472acb33aeab7170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-763bd983c9440f6332b03769ffa52077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19398f2e97c0d818beb2f7da07fc12c</data>
