    <node id="机电系统">
      <data key="d0">机电系统</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Mechatronic system is an integrated system that combines mechanical, electrical, and computer science components.&lt;SEP&gt;The '机电系统' is a system that combines mechanical and electrical components, typically found in industrial or domestic settings.&lt;SEP&gt;The mechanical and electrical system is the focus of the text, discussing its heat generation and potential faults.&lt;SEP&gt;机电系统是指机械和电气结合的系统，故障诊断与维修案例教程。&lt;SEP&gt;机电系统是指由机械和电子设备组成的系统。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ba5e16308525584985e229da38004bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb58ef07953cfa7d2761587f8cf0115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-918985d61c599672b319aea8dbf10d69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d02a948c6d8696d3214246a1d3817b</data>
