    <node id="空气">
      <data key="d0">空气</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Air in the hydraulic cylinder may cause problems such as binding or crawling of the piston rod.&lt;SEP&gt;Air refers to the gas that is present in the hydraulic system which can cause malfunctions.&lt;SEP&gt;空气是液压系统中可能存在的气体，需要排除以防止系统故障。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4872ddd77cc800597c3ee787f9eb86f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d81d1586fab16b83b27100e99262851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8a217882c9a1b2088793a95ff06b9d2</data>
