    <node id="导轨">
      <data key="d0">导轨</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Guideways in hydraulic systems are used to guide the movement of components, such as hydraulic cylinders, and may need inspection and repair.&lt;SEP&gt;The guide rail is a linear guide used to support and guide the movement of a reciprocating or linear mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;导轨是支撑和引导运动部件的轨道，用于确保运动的准确性。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12b8d796408b133d3c0527a86eb30f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8a217882c9a1b2088793a95ff06b9d2</data>
