    <node id="压力波动">
      <data key="d0">压力波动</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Pressure fluctuations within a hydraulic system can occur due to various factors and need to be controlled within a reasonable range.&lt;SEP&gt;压力波动是指液压系统中压力的突然变化，可能由多种原因引起。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8a217882c9a1b2088793a95ff06b9d2</data>
