    <node id="系统压力">
      <data key="d0">系统压力</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">System pressure refers to the pressure within a hydraulic system that is maintained at a certain level.&lt;SEP&gt;System pressure refers to the pressure within a hydraulic system, which needs to be adjusted to appropriate levels for optimal performance.&lt;SEP&gt;System pressure refers to the pressure within the hydraulic system, which needs to be adjusted to ensure proper operation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d02a948c6d8696d3214246a1d3817b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dba5683e0ed1465472acb33aeab7170</data>
