    </node>
    <node id="调速阀">
      <data key="d0">调速阀</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A flow control valve is a device used to regulate the flow rate of hydraulic fluid, also relevant to the troubleshooting and maintenance of hydraulic systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A throttle valve is a type of valve used to control the flow of a fluid in a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;The flow control valve is a device used to control the flow rate of a fluid in a hydraulic or pneumatic system.&lt;SEP&gt;调速阀是一种液压元件，用于调节流量和压力，保持稳定的流量和压力输出。&lt;SEP&gt;调速阀是一种调节液压系统流量和压力的元件，用于控制液压缸的运动速度。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce35f55aea19b816755795fdfbc6828b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07b41e601c2450e9357224ccdeaae5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e9e21580951e8a602128573cf01cefc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b90a52c6f070fb2b7a91103d66a84</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
