    </node>
    <node id="电路">
      <data key="d0">电路</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An electrical circuit, a path for electrical current.&lt;SEP&gt;Circuits are discussed in the context of electrical connections and measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;Circuits in hydraulic systems are responsible for controlling the operation of various components and may require inspection and repair.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1c014fb2404e67618835e7de0d2b18d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ccaecd9db63131912026a39494539cd</data>
