    <node id="元件">
      <data key="d0">元件</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Components are parts that make up a system or machine and can include valves, filters, and other devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Components in a hydraulic system, such as pumps, valves, and cylinders, require regular inspection and maintenance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96e2a482ca44d58c3fdc7888a608fdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75a60589f148604737e73dda0982c00b</data>
