    <node id="检修">
      <data key="d0">检修</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Inspection and maintenance are procedures performed on hydraulic systems to ensure their proper functioning and longevity.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of repairing faults is crucial in reducing the time taken for maintenance activities.</data>
