      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A sliding valve used to control the flow of fluid in hydraulic systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Sliding valve is a type of valve that moves to control the flow of fluid in a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;The slider valve is a type of valve that moves linearly within the valve body to control fluid flow.&lt;SEP&gt;滑阀是一种常见的阀门类型，用于调节和控制流体的流动。&lt;SEP&gt;滑阀是一种用于控制流体流动方向的阀门，通过滑动阀芯来调节流量。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2af5a36d856b334200291be646fe56c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c409a3cee64edbdc95bfdfc6401b9a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4872ddd77cc800597c3ee787f9eb86f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e9e21580951e8a602128573cf01cefc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b90a52c6f070fb2b7a91103d66a84</data>
