    <node id="缓冲装置">
      <data key="d0">缓冲装置</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A buffer device used at the end of a hydraulic cylinder to control exhaust speed and prevent shock.&lt;SEP&gt;The buffer device is a part of a mechanical system that absorbs shock and reduces vibration.&lt;SEP&gt;The buffer device is part of the hydraulic system that may experience failure, leading to issues such as excessive travel and crawling.&lt;SEP&gt;缓冲装置是气缸中的一个部件，文中讨论了缓冲装置处调节阀、单向阀泄漏的故障和维修方法。</data>
