    </node>
    <node id="密封圈">
      <data key="d0">密封圈</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The密封圈 (sealing ring) is a critical component employed in hydraulic systems, serving as a mechanical gasket designed specifically to prevent fluid leakage. It acts as a seal ring, providing a crucial barrier between various parts within the hydraulic system to ensure that liquids or gases do not escape from the intended space or container. This seal is essential in preventing crawling phenomena, which can be significantly affected by the proper selection and installation of the seal. The密封圈 is thus an integral part of maintaining the integrity and efficiency of hydraulic systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0f966e87923041bdf721a6c9dd71a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-205e5b50ed08e4587699576c3110fefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67175ab18c23c1816a4f561e5a5d372b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-906931c649f16a44721b0eebb71f69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a4a03155fa2a96e34f47616ffe0cae</data>
