    <node id="阀芯">
      <data key="d0">阀芯</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The valve core, also known as 阀芯, is a critical component within valves, particularly in hydraulic systems. It is a movable part that serves to control the flow of fluid or gas through the valve. As a core element in hydraulic valves, the valve core is responsible for regulating the direction and pressure of the fluid. It must be smooth and free from rust and burrs to ensure efficient operation. In the context of a hydraulic system, the valve core is integral to both hydraulic valves and directional valves, as it is involved in managing the flow of fluid, whether it is a simple flow control or the direction of fluid flow. The descriptions also mention issues such as valve core becoming stuck and springs breaking, highlighting potential problems that can arise in its operation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c409a3cee64edbdc95bfdfc6401b9a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dba5683e0ed1465472acb33aeab7170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e927ef66eacdc3741d7a8dbda2d77531&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da66b4ba559873998867a86514a5f09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45c7f498930072d1430aac19bea884b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0afc77668cb79a17228f50d78996acd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e9e21580951e8a602128573cf01cefc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752800</data>
    </node>
