    <node id="齿轮泵">
      <data key="d0">齿轮泵</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Gear pump is a type of pump used in hydraulic systems for fluid conveyance.&lt;SEP&gt;Gear pump, a component used in the hydraulic system for pressure energy.&lt;SEP&gt;齿轮泵是一种液压泵，此处描述了其故障诊断与维修。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0afc77668cb79a17228f50d78996acd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91db0f3b864a7198d442ec1ab788a5bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e3fd9231e91f4d605026c7e65ac9e82</data>
