      <data key="d2">Pump body is the main housing of the hydraulic pump that contains the internal components.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump housing is the main body of a pump, which contains and supports the pump's internal components.&lt;SEP&gt;泵体是齿轮泵的壳体，提供结构支撑和流体通道。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-906931c649f16a44721b0eebb71f69b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0afc77668cb79a17228f50d78996acd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab</data>
