    <node id="叶片泵">
      <data key="d0">叶片泵</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Gear pump is a type of positive displacement pump that uses gears to move fluid. It is used in hydraulic systems and other applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Vane pump is a type of pump used in hydraulic systems for fluid conveyance.&lt;SEP&gt;叶片泵是一种液压系统中的泵，主要用于固定安装的液压设备和船舶上，具有流量均匀、运转平稳、噪声低、结构紧凑等优点。</data>
