    </node>
    <node id="定子">
      <data key="d0">定子</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity in question is the "定子," which is a stationary component integral to both electric motors and generators. It serves as the housing for vanes and provides a sealing surface, ensuring efficient operation. The primary function of the定子 is to convert mechanical energy into electrical energy or vice versa, depending on the application. Specifically, in an electric motor, the定子 is responsible for generating a magnetic field that enables the rotation of the rotor. This magnetic field is crucial for the motor's operation, as it facilitates the transmission of electrical energy. In certain contexts, the定子 is also mentioned in relation to internal dimensions like its inner diameter and the number of winding turns, indicating a focus on its design and construction details. Additionally, the定子 can be part of a speed relay, where it is fixed to a bracket, further highlighting its versatility within various mechanical systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0f966e87923041bdf721a6c9dd71a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c0759493d2164571db1415c10cc5964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2e809e2424701c731a2da5e003621fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7717f9c647b8d45b1cefa44db848f23a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752803</data>
    </node>
    <node id="转子">
      <data key="d0">转子</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The转子 is a critical rotating component found in various machinery, including pumps and electric motors. It plays a pivotal role in the conversion of electrical energy into mechanical energy and is responsible for the fluid flow in pumps. Specifically, in an electric motor or generator, the转子 is the part that carries the magnetic field and is driven by the power source. It is a major component of an electric motor, working in conjunction with the stator to produce mechanical motion. In the context of the discussion, the outer diameter of the rotor is mentioned, along with issues related to its maintenance. Additionally, the转子 is also a part of a speed relay, which is connected to the motor shaft.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c0759493d2164571db1415c10cc5964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67175ab18c23c1816a4f561e5a5d372b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2e809e2424701c731a2da5e003621fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7717f9c647b8d45b1cefa44db848f23a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752806</data>
    </node>
    <node id="叶片">
      <data key="d0">叶片</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A component of a pump or turbine that moves fluid by means of its shape and motion.&lt;SEP&gt;A flat or curved piece that is used to direct fluid flow in a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Blade is a component of a blade motor used to convert electrical energy into mechanical energy.&lt;SEP&gt;The vanes inside the pump that move the hydraulic oil and create pressure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0f966e87923041bdf721a6c9dd71a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
