      <data key="d2">A component in pumps that directs the flow of fluid, typically made of metal or other durable materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A disk or plate that is used to direct the flow of fluid in a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;A disk that controls the flow of fluid into and out of the pump chamber in a hydraulic pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Poppet valve is a type of valve used in hydraulic systems to control the flow of fluid.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67175ab18c23c1816a4f561e5a5d372b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46dfba00c0347934428630b20499263f</data>
