      <data key="d0">排气阀</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Exhaust valve, a valve that opens and closes to control the flow of exhaust gases from the engine cylinder.&lt;SEP&gt;The exhaust valve is a component of the air compressor that allows compressed air to be released into the output pipe.&lt;SEP&gt;排气阀是用于排除泵内空气的装置。</data>
