    <node id="故障现象">
      <data key="d0">故障现象</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Fault phenomena refer to the manifestations of malfunctions or problems within a system. These phenomena encompass the symptoms and visible signs that indicate the occurrence of an electrical issue or other problems in a circuit or component. In the context of a pneumatic system, fault phenomena may include the failure of a specific valve, such as valve 3's inability to change direction and valve 2's unreliable operation. The term also covers the symptoms observed when a fault occurs in a pump or any other system or component, highlighting the need for attention to potential issues within the electrical system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0f966e87923041bdf721a6c9dd71a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1c014fb2404e67618835e7de0d2b18d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6103ba22bb6c61bce7a5a49c9d15bd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e927ef66eacdc3741d7a8dbda2d77531&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb58ef07953cfa7d2761587f8cf0115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45c7f498930072d1430aac19bea884b8</data>
