      <data key="d2">The causes of faults in hydraulic systems can be attributed to various factors, such as contamination or wear.&lt;SEP&gt;The reasons behind the occurrence of a fault in an electrical system.&lt;SEP&gt;This category lists the causes behind the different fault phenomena of the pump.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0f966e87923041bdf721a6c9dd71a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da66b4ba559873998867a86514a5f09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb58ef07953cfa7d2761587f8cf0115</data>
