    <node id="缸筒">
      <data key="d0">缸筒</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A component in hydraulic cylinders that provides the enclosed space for fluid movement.&lt;SEP&gt;The cylinder is a component that may need repair or replacement due to expansion or poor internal conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The cylindrical part of a hydraulic cylinder, providing the space for the piston to move within.&lt;SEP&gt;缸筒是气缸的一个组成部分，文中讨论了缸筒缸径变化和维修方法。&lt;SEP&gt;缸筒是液压缸中容纳活塞和油液的部件，为活塞的运动提供空间。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4d81d1586fab16b83b27100e99262851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67175ab18c23c1816a4f561e5a5d372b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07b41e601c2450e9357224ccdeaae5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-534fef71aa29d8e72825da70b7772d5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a4a03155fa2a96e34f47616ffe0cae</data>
