      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A component that guides the movement of the piston rod within the cylinder, ensuring smooth operation.&lt;SEP&gt;A component used in hydraulic cylinders to guide the movement of the piston rod.&lt;SEP&gt;The guide sleeve is a component that may have an insufficient gap with the piston rod, leading to binding issues.&lt;SEP&gt;导向套是液压缸中用于引导活塞杆运动的部件，减少运动阻力。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e07b41e601c2450e9357224ccdeaae5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d81d1586fab16b83b27100e99262851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a4a03155fa2a96e34f47616ffe0cae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67175ab18c23c1816a4f561e5a5d372b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
