    <node id="缸盖">
      <data key="d0">缸盖</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The cover of the cylinder barrel that provides access to the internal components of the cylinder.&lt;SEP&gt;The cover of the hydraulic cylinder barrel that provides access to the internal components.&lt;SEP&gt;The cylinder head is a component of an internal combustion engine that covers the top of the cylinder block and contains the combustion chamber.&lt;SEP&gt;The cylinder head is a part of the hydraulic system that may have issues with the buffer ring attached to it.&lt;SEP&gt;The cylinder head is part of the hydraulic system where the fixed buffer throttle ring and buffer piston are located, potentially with a small gap.</data>
