    <node id="衬套">
      <data key="d0">衬套</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A bushing or衬套is a sleeve that fits over a shaft to provide a smooth rotating surface.&lt;SEP&gt;The sleeve is a component of the hydraulic system that may also have internal surface damage.</data>
