      <data key="d2">A threaded fastener used to fasten or join two or more objects together.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of fastener used to secure items in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolt is a fastener used to join parts of a hydraulic system together.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7717f9c647b8d45b1cefa44db848f23a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e927ef66eacdc3741d7a8dbda2d77531&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f6ef4602a8cc5fe00045efd25f0fa6</data>
