      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Debris refers to foreign matter that can enter a hydraulic system and cause damage or malfunctions.&lt;SEP&gt;Foreign materials or substances that can cause electrical faults or impair the performance of electrical components.</data>
