    <node id="阀体">
      <data key="d0">阀体</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The valve body, referred to as 阀体 in the Chinese context, serves as the principal structural component of a valve assembly. It is the main housing that encompasses and supports the internal components, including the valve seat and the flow path for fluid. This vital part of the valve system not only contains and fixes the valve core and other components but also provides a designated path for the fluid or gas to flow. The valve body offers structural support and is instrumental in housing the moving parts within the valve. Additionally, it is a constituent part of a hydraulic valve, specifically in the case of a liquid-controlled check valve, where it plays a crucial role in containing and stabilizing the valve core and other associated components.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c409a3cee64edbdc95bfdfc6401b9a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dba5683e0ed1465472acb33aeab7170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e927ef66eacdc3741d7a8dbda2d77531&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4872ddd77cc800597c3ee787f9eb86f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33e23acdd91f6c00f8ea0955e56b43ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45c7f498930072d1430aac19bea884b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b90a52c6f070fb2b7a91103d66a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c024958832b9f4d0025ff359e81b3839</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752821</data>
    </node>
    <node id="阀座">
      <data key="d0">阀座</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A stationary part of a valve that the valve core seats against.&lt;SEP&gt;The seat of a valve that provides a sealing surface for the valve core.&lt;SEP&gt;The seat of a valve, which is in contact with the sealing pad to maintain a seal when the valve is closed.&lt;SEP&gt;The valve seat is a component that may require repair or replacement due to misalignment issues with the conical surface.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-763bd983c9440f6332b03769ffa52077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e927ef66eacdc3741d7a8dbda2d77531&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33e23acdd91f6c00f8ea0955e56b43ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45c7f498930072d1430aac19bea884b8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752821</data>
    </node>
