      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A device used to reduce the pressure of a fluid or gas in a system to a safe level.&lt;SEP&gt;Pressure reducing valve is a device in a hydraulic system designed to decrease the pressure of the fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;Pressure reducing valve is a device used to control the pressure of a fluid, typically used to reduce high pressure to a lower, safe level.&lt;SEP&gt;The pressure reducing valve is a component of the pneumatic system that adjusts the pressure of the compressed air.&lt;SEP&gt;减压阀是一种用来降低流体压力的阀门，常用于液压系统中以调节压力。</data>
