    <node id="动铁芯">
      <data key="d0">动铁芯</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A moving core in an electromagnetic valve that is attracted or repelled by an electromagnetic force.&lt;SEP&gt;The armature is a component of the electromagnetic system that moves towards the core when the coil is energized.&lt;SEP&gt;The moving core is part of the electromagnetic valve, which is moved by the electromagnetic force when the solenoid is energized.&lt;SEP&gt;动铁芯是接触器中的一个活动部件，它在电磁线圈产生的磁场作用下移动，从而实现接触器的吸合和释放。</data>
