    <node id="接触器">
      <data key="d0">接触器</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The contactor, an essential electrical device, is specifically designed for switching and control within electrical circuits. It serves as an electrical switch utilized in control circuits and features distinct resistance values necessary for normal operation. Primarily employed to automatically connect or disconnect high-current circuits, contactors are commonly used for controlling the power supply to motors and various control circuits. They are particularly suited for industrial applications where large currents need to be managed. Additionally, the discussion of contactors also encompasses their potential faults and the procedures for their maintenance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee9c850f2bcdf0f748d9c6a77d4b1f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a14106bd728509626d998218e1f4815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb9a307bb2e286ef8dcf8f76eb605627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2e809e2424701c731a2da5e003621fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8937cc461c49ff4f29a51b4e347a34b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1971066a581f0990af3c8c34cc992fbb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752831</data>
    </node>
    <node id="热继电器">
      <data key="d0">热继电器</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A thermal relay, an automatic switch used in circuits to protect against excessive current or overheating.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermal relays are protective devices that open a circuit when the current exceeds a safe level, preventing damage to the equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;热继电器是一种用于电动机过载保护的设备，通过发热元件和触头来控制电动机的电路。&lt;SEP&gt;热继电器是一种电动机过载保护装置，由双金属片、电阻丝和触头组成。&lt;SEP&gt;热继电器是一种电气保护设备，用于防止电动机过载运行。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a14106bd728509626d998218e1f4815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2e809e2424701c731a2da5e003621fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ccaecd9db63131912026a39494539cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af8795d4866f9a3fd7af5f9fcdd83b98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1971066a581f0990af3c8c34cc992fbb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1748752831</data>
    </node>
    <node id="时间继电器">
      <data key="d0">时间继电器</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A timer relay, an electrical device that provides time delays in the control circuits.&lt;SEP&gt;Time relays are used to control circuits for a specific duration, allowing for precise timing in various applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1971066a581f0990af3c8c34cc992fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ccaecd9db63131912026a39494539cd</data>
