    <node id="线路">
      <data key="d0">线路</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">'Circuit' is an organization or system that carries electrical current from the power supply to the motor and can have issues that affect the motor's operation.&lt;SEP&gt;The '线路' refers to the wiring or circuitry that carries electricity or signals within a system.&lt;SEP&gt;The electrical wiring that carries the current and is part of the system that experienced a short circuit.</data>
