      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">'Switches or starting equipment' are organizations or devices that control the operation of the motor and can have contact issues that affect the motor's starting.&lt;SEP&gt;开关或启动设备用于控制电动机的启动和停止。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9a115a0aab11c06dbf9d37ae8dc8807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7717f9c647b8d45b1cefa44db848f23a</data>
