      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">'Y connection method' is an event or configuration of the motor's winding that can experience issues like line breaks.&lt;SEP&gt;A wiring configuration for motor windings in the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9a115a0aab11c06dbf9d37ae8dc8807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7717f9c647b8d45b1cefa44db848f23a</data>
