      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">'Delta connection method' is an event or configuration of the motor's winding that can experience issues like line breaks.&lt;SEP&gt;△接法是电动机绕组的另一种连接方式，文中提到定子绕组误接成△接法。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9a115a0aab11c06dbf9d37ae8dc8807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c0759493d2164571db1415c10cc5964</data>
