      <data key="d2">'Grounding wire' is an organization or component that provides a connection to the ground, and issues with it can affect the motor's operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Grounding wires are used to connect electrical devices to the earth to provide a safe path for electrical current in the event of a fault.</data>
