      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Interference refers to any unwanted signal or disturbance that affects the operation of a system.&lt;SEP&gt;Interference refers to the unwanted effect on a system or device caused by external factors such as electromagnetic radiation or electrical noise.</data>
