    <node id="导轨2">
      <data key="d0">导轨2</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Guide rail 2 is a critical component within the system, designed to facilitate the precise movement of parts. It is mounted on guide rail 1 and is powered by a motor, enabling it to move along the length of guide rail 1. As part of the mechanical system, guide rail 2 plays a role in extending to engage with and transport blank parts. However, it deviates from its expected function by not retracting as intended, leading to inconsistencies in the process. It represents the second guide rail in the system, reaching the front end position upon completing a specific operation. In the context of the text document, guide rail 2 is identified as an organization or system component, underscoring its integral role within the overall system architecture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-12b8d796408b133d3c0527a86eb30f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36dcf6c0515691cd21aa7ba7814e1b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9c657c59529c328c43eda12266ba280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd092a336c42ff6f15dddc88a96d87f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f97d231de71b96f3f3b869aa0ce077f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa66717db2d8392ca7818f0ab87af2b4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
