    <node id="导轨1">
      <data key="d0">导轨1</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Guide rail 1 is part of the mechanical system, moving to the blank position during system operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Guide rail 1 is part of the piece pressing system, installed on guide rail 2 and driven by a motor.&lt;SEP&gt;The category is a guide rail that moves to the left to the parts library in the first step of the process.&lt;SEP&gt;导轨1 is an organization or system component mentioned in the text document.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-36dcf6c0515691cd21aa7ba7814e1b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f97d231de71b96f3f3b869aa0ce077f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa66717db2d8392ca7818f0ab87af2b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12b8d796408b133d3c0527a86eb30f6f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
