    </node>
    <node id="气动手指">
      <data key="d0">气动手指</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Pneumatic finger has completed the gripping action but was not detected by Sensor SE5V.&lt;SEP&gt;Pneumatic finger is part of the mechanical system, used to grab the blank part.&lt;SEP&gt;Pneumatic fingers are installed on guide rail 2 and are used to pick up parts from the left component library.&lt;SEP&gt;The category is a pneumatic finger used for gripping parts in a manufacturing process.&lt;SEP&gt;The pneumatic finger is the part of the system that is being manipulated by the valves and cylinders to grasp objects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-12b8d796408b133d3c0527a86eb30f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c17e017f2003387174a436cdb95e1f2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb01b0c8f343be722f1698f053da285&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f97d231de71b96f3f3b869aa0ce077f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa66717db2d8392ca7818f0ab87af2b4</data>
