    <edge source="拆卸方法" target="装配">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The process of assembly involves various disassembly methods, such as impact removal, pressing and pulling off, and heating disassembly, depending on the part fit.</data>
      <data key="d8">assembly process,disassembly method</data>
