    <edge source="轴上定位零件" target="齿轮">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Axial locating parts are used in the assembly of gears to ensure their precise positioning within the shaft assembly."|&gt;"assembly components, gear positioning</data>
