    </edge>
    <edge source="啮合" target="齿轮">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Gears engage with each other to transmit motion and power in a gear train.&lt;SEP&gt;The concept of meshing is related to gears, which engage in a precise manner during assembly to transmit motion and power."|&gt;"mechanical engagement, transmission of motion</data>
      <data key="d8">8,Essential for operation,mechanical interaction"</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
