      <data key="d7">Gear is part of the pump housing, where it is subject to wear and requires repair or maintenance.</data>
      <data key="d8">component part,wear</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="齿轮" target="滚针轴承">
      <data key="d6">4.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Gear is in contact with roller bearings, which can wear over time and require replacement or repair.</data>
      <data key="d8">component contact,wear</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="齿轮" target="轴套">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Gear is in contact with sleeves, which can wear and require replacement or repair.</data>
      <data key="d8">component contact,wear</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="齿轮" target="叶片泵">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Gear is part of the gear pump, which is used in hydraulic systems and other applications.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,component part</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ec89303a6088293925f758d2cbbf49ab</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="滚动轴承" target="淋油或油枪喷射">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The methods of applying oil to bearings for cleaning and lubrication are used on rolling bearings.</data>
      <data key="d8">bearing type,lubrication method</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-45ba06ce22ee19f5d752b6523954299d</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="滚动轴承" target="检查内圈、外圈滚道">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"When inspecting rolling bearings, it is important to check the inner and outer raceways for defects.</data>
      <data key="d8">bearing components,inspection process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-45ba06ce22ee19f5d752b6523954299d</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复机械零件故障" target="修复工艺措施">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Repair process measures are employed to address mechanical component failures and restore equipment functionality."|&gt;"repair method, component failure</data>
      <data key="d8">9</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复工艺措施" target="修复技术">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Repair technologies are part of the repair process measures used to restore the functionality of damaged components."|&gt;"repair technology, process measure</data>
      <data key="d8">8</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复工艺措施" target="修复层">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Repair layers are a component of repair process measures, applied to restore the functionality of damaged components."|&gt;"repair layer, process measure</data>
      <data key="d8">7</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a9e974b3af6506d86c1cfa2d59bfd0fa</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复技术" target="修补层">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The thickness and mechanical properties of the repair layer are important factors in selecting the appropriate repair technique.</data>
      <data key="d8">repair method,selection criteria</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复技术" target="工作状况">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The choice of repair technique depends on the work condition of the mechanical part, such as rolling or sliding states, which affect the contact stress and appropriate repair methods.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,work condition</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复技术" target="生产可行性">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The feasibility of repair techniques should be considered based on the available equipment, repair technology, and production management in the workshop.</data>
      <data key="d8">feasibility,selection</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复技术" target="经济性">
      <data key="d6">5.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The economic feasibility of repair techniques involves evaluating the cost and lifespan of the repaired part to determine the best option.</data>
      <data key="d8">economic factors,evaluation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复层" target="修补层的力学性能">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The mechanical properties of the repair layer are a critical aspect of its effectiveness in repairs.</data>
      <data key="d8">performance,repair layer</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复层" target="结合强度">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The strength of the bond between the repair layer and the part is important for the durability of the repair.</data>
      <data key="d8">bond strength,durability</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修复层" target="表面强度">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The surface strength of the repaired part is a measure of the repair's success.</data>
      <data key="d8">success,surface strength</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修补层" target="维修尺寸法">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The maintenance size method is a technique that can restore the dimensions and precision of worn parts, affecting the choice of the repair layer.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,repair layer</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修补层" target="镶装零件法">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The insertion part method may require the application of a repair layer to restore the original size and precision of the part after wear or damage.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,repair layer</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修补层" target="局部修换法">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The local replacement method can be used in conjunction with the repair layer to restore the serviceability of parts after wear or damage.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,repair layer</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修补层" target="塑性变形法">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The plastic deformation method can be used with the repair layer to restore the shape and size of the part after deformation.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,repair layer</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="修补层" target="金属扣合法">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The metal扣合法may involve the application of a repair layer to reconnect fractured parts securely.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,repair layer</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f2714adef57ebf31098afe9ba8240006</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="气焊" target="category">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Gas welding is a type of welding that uses a flame produced by the combustion of fuel gas and oxidizing gas to melt and join metals, which is one of the welding methods.</data>
      <data key="d8">flame welding,welding method</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="强固扣合法" target="焊接修复法">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Strong fixation method is a type of welding repair technique, which is used for repairing cracks or fractures in machinery.</data>
      <data key="d8">mechanical repair,repair technique</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="强密扣合法" target="焊接修复法">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Strong density method is a type of welding repair technique, which is used for repairing cracks or fractures in machinery.</data>
      <data key="d8">mechanical repair,repair technique</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="优级扣合法" target="焊接修复法">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Superior grade method is a type of welding repair technique, which is used for repairing cracks or fractures in machinery.</data>
      <data key="d8">mechanical repair,repair technique</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="热扣合法" target="焊接修复法">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Heat fixation method is a type of welding repair technique, which is used for repairing cracks or fractures in machinery and affects material properties.</data>
      <data key="d8">material property effect,repair technique</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接修复法" target="金属零件">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Welding repair method is used to repair metal parts, which can be damaged due to wear, breakage, cracks, or dents.</data>
      <data key="d8">metal part,repair application</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="金属零件" target="电弧焊">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Electric arc welding is a method used to repair metal parts, providing high bonding strength and ease of use.</data>
      <data key="d8">metal part,repair method</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊条电弧焊" target="category">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Welding with a welding rod is a manual welding technique that uses a consumable electrode to produce an electric arc for joining metal parts, which is a widely used welding method.</data>
      <data key="d8">manual welding,welding method</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f21e9d4b1c87d6e475e8f8c9fce292b9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接" target="焊工">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Welders are essential for performing welding tasks, which involve high skill levels and challenging working conditions.</data>
      <data key="d8">welder skill,welding process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接" target="电弧焊机">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">An electric arc welding machine is an essential tool used in the welding process.</data>
      <data key="d8">equipment requirement,welding process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接" target="设备使用注意事项">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Safety guidelines must be followed when using welding equipment to prevent accidents and ensure safe operation.</data>
      <data key="d8">safety measures,welding operation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接" target="焊接电缆">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Welding cables are used in welding to provide the necessary electrical connections and must be handled with care.</data>
      <data key="d8">cable use,welding process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接" target="焊条选择">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The selection of welding rods is crucial for the success of the welding process, depending on the material and conditions of the workpiece.</data>
      <data key="d8">welding process,welding rod selection</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接" target="钎焊">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Soldering is a type of welding that uses a lower melting point metal to join two pieces of metal, offering various advantages.</data>
      <data key="d8">material joining,welding type</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接" target="焊条">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Welding rods are a necessary material for the welding process, used to join metals together.</data>
      <data key="d8">material,welding process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="焊接" target="电镀修复技术">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Electroplating is a related process to welding, both involving the application of metal layers to surfaces.</data>
      <data key="d8">surface treatment,welding process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="钎焊" target="烙铁钎焊">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Tin soldering is a specific method of soldering that uses a soldering iron for heating, suitable for soft solders.</data>
      <data key="d8">soft solder,soldering method</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="钎焊" target="火焰钎焊">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Flame soldering is a technique within the broader category of soldering, which is a type of welding.</data>
      <data key="d8">soldering,technique</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e509459f488a320e1102918c1b1700a5</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1748752834</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="钎焊" target="修复">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">钎焊是修复技术中的一种，用于修复零件的裂纹和断裂。</data>
      <data key="d8">修复方法,钎焊应用</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5cec839b9f36b19446104b0ebb382214</data>
